msgctxt "No known user"
msgid "None"
msgstr "Nihče"

msgid "User avatar"
msgstr "Uporabi podobo"

msgid ""
"This e-mail address is already in use. Please supply a different e-mail "
"address."
msgstr "Ta elektronski naslov je že v uporabi. Uporabite drugega."

msgid "This username is already taken. Please pick something else."
msgstr "To uporabniško ime je že zasedeno. Prosim izberite nekaj drugega."

msgid "Full name"
msgstr "Polno ime"

msgid "Name is also used in version control commits."
msgstr "Ime se uporablja tudi v nadzoru različic."

msgid "Commit e-mail"
msgstr "Pošlji e-pošto"

msgid "Use account e-mail address"
msgstr "Uporabite e-poštni naslov računa"

msgid ""
"Used in version-control commits. The address stays in the repository forever "
"once changes are committed by Weblate."
msgstr ""
"Uporablja se pri potrditvah za nadzor različic. Naslov ostane v repozitoriju "
"za vedno, ko Weblate potrdi spremembe."

msgid "Commit name"
msgstr "Ime objave"

msgid ""
"Used in version control commits. The name stays in the repository forever, "
"once changes are committed by Weblate."
msgstr ""
"Uporablja se pri potrditvah za nadzor različic. Ime ostane v skladišču za "
"vedno, ko Weblate potrdi spremembe."

msgid "Public e-mail"
msgstr "Javni elektronski naslov"

msgid "Hide e-mail address from public view"
msgstr "Skrij e-poštni naslov iz javnega pogleda"

#, python-format
msgid "Component list: %s"
msgstr "Seznam komponent: %s"

msgid "Account e-mail"
msgstr "E-naslov računa"

msgid ""
"Used for e-mail notifications and as a commit e-mail if it is not configured "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Uporablja se za e-poštna obvestila in kot e-poštno sporočilo za potrditev, "
"če ni konfigurirano spodaj."

msgid "Human verification"
msgstr "Preverjanje osebe"

#, python-format
msgctxt ""
"Question for a mathematics-based CAPTCHA, the %s is an arithmetic problem"
msgid "What is %s?"
msgstr "Koliko je %s?"

#. Translators: Shown on wrong answer to the mathematics-based CAPTCHA
msgid "That was not correct, please try again."
msgstr "To ni bilo pravilno. Prosimo, poskusite znova."

msgid "Validation failed, please try again."
msgstr "Preverjanje je spodletelo, poskusite znova."

msgid "Subject"
msgstr "Zadeva"

msgid "Your name"
msgstr "Vaše ime"

msgid "Your e-mail"
msgstr "Vaš e-poštni naslov"

msgid "Message"
msgstr "Sporočilo"

msgid ""
"Please contact us in English. Otherwise, we might not process your request."
msgstr ""
"Prosimo, da stopite v stik z nami v angleščini; sicer morda ne bomo mogli "
"obdelati vaše zahteve."

msgid "E-mail"
msgstr "E-pošta"

msgid "An e-mail with a confirmation link will be sent here."
msgstr "E-sporočilo s potrditveno povezavo bo poslana sem."

msgid "New password"
msgstr "Novo geslo"

msgid "New password confirmation"
msgstr "Potrditev novega gesla"

msgid "Regenerate API key"
msgstr "Ponovno ustvari ključ API"

msgid ""
"Leave enabled to revoke the current API key and generate a new one. This is "
"recommended if you suspect your password was compromised. Disable it to keep "
"your current API key active after changing your password."
msgstr ""

msgid "Your password has been changed."
msgstr "Vaše geslo smo spremenili."

msgid "Current password"
msgstr "Trenutno geslo"

msgid "Leave empty if you have not set a password yet."
msgstr "Pustite prazno, če še niste nastavili gesla."

msgid "You have entered an invalid password."
msgstr "Vnesli ste neveljavno geslo."

msgid "Username or e-mail"
msgstr "Uporabniško ime ali e-pošta"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "Geslo"

msgid "Please enter the correct username and password."
msgstr "Prosimo, vnesite pravilno uporabniško ime in geslo."

msgid "This account is inactive."
msgstr "Račun ni dejaven."

msgid "Component wide notifications"
msgstr "Obvestila po celotni komponenti"

msgid "Translation notifications"
msgstr "Obvestila o prevodih"

msgid "Use default setting"
msgstr "Uporabi privzeto nastavitev"

msgid "Other projects"
msgstr "Drugi projekti"

msgid "Watched projects"
msgstr "Spremljani projekti"

msgid "Managed projects"
msgstr "Upravljani projekti"

msgid "Project: {}"
msgstr "Projekt: {}"

msgid "Component: {}"
msgstr "Komponenta: {}"

msgid ""
"You will receive a notification for every such event in non-watched projects."
msgstr ""
"Prejeli boste obvestilo ob vsakem takšnem dogodku v ne spremljanih projektih."

msgid ""
"You will receive a notification for every such event in your watched "
"projects."
msgstr ""
"Prejeli boste obvestilo ob vsakem takšnem dogodku v vaših spremljanih "
"projektih."

msgid ""
"You will receive a notification for every such event in projects where you "
"have admin permissions."
msgstr ""
"Prejeli boste obvestilo ob vsakem takšnem dogodku v projektih kjer imate "
"skrbniške pravice."

#, python-format
msgid "You will receive a notification for every such event in %(project)s."
msgstr ""
"Prejeli boste obvestilo ob vsakem takšnem dogodku v projektu %(project)s."

#, python-format
msgid "You will receive a notification for every such event in %(component)s."
msgstr ""
"Prejeli boste obvestilo ob vsakem takšnem dogodku v komponenti %(component)s."

msgid ""
"You will only receive these notifications for your translated languages in "
"non-watched projects."
msgstr ""
"Ta obvestila boste prejemali samo za svoje prevodne jezike v ne spremljanih "
"projektih."

msgid ""
"You will only receive these notifications for your translated languages in "
"your watched projects."
msgstr ""
"Ta obvestila boste prejemali samo za vaše prevedene jezike v vaših "
"spremljanih projektih."

msgid ""
"You will only receive these notifications for your translated languages in "
"projects where you have admin permissions."
msgstr ""
"Ta obvestila boste prejemali samo za vaše prevedene jezike v projektih, kjer "
"imate administratorske pravice."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You will only receive these notifications for your translated languages in "
"%(project)s."
msgstr ""
"Ta obvestila boste prejemali samo za vaše prevedene jezike v projektu "
"%(project)s."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You will only receive these notifications for your translated languages in "
"%(component)s."
msgstr ""
"Ta obvestila boste prejemali samo za vaše prevedene jezike v komponentah "
"%(component)s."

msgid "Username"
msgstr "Uporabniško ime"

msgid "Date joined"
msgstr "Datum pridružitve"

msgid "Translations made"
msgstr "Oddani prevodi"

msgid "Suggestions made"
msgstr "Oddani predlogi"

msgid "Comments made"
msgstr "Komentarji"

msgid "Screenshots uploaded"
msgstr "Zaslonski posnetki naloženi"

msgid "The chosen sorting is not supported."
msgstr "Izbrano razvrščanje ni podprto."

msgid "Team"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Add user to a team"
msgid "Add to a team"
msgstr "Dodaj uporabnika v ekipo"

msgid "Name your authentication app"
msgstr "Poimenujte svojo aplikacijo za preverjanje pristnosti"

msgid "Verify the code from the app"
msgstr "Potrdite kodo iz aplikacije"

msgid "Discard previously configured authentication apps"
msgstr "Zavrzi predhodno konfigurirane aplikacije za preverjanje pristnosti"

msgid ""
"All previously configured authentication apps will be discarded upon "
"verification of the new app."
msgstr ""
"Vse prej konfigurirane aplikacije za preverjanje pristnosti bodo po "
"preverjanju nove aplikacije zavržene."

msgid ""
"Other two-factor methods (such as WebAuthn and security keys) won't be "
"affected."
msgstr ""
"Druge dvofaktorske metode (kot sta WebAuthn in varnostni ključi) ne bodo "
"prizadete."

msgid "The entered token is not valid."
msgstr "Vneseni žeton ni veljaven."

msgid "Recovery token"
msgstr "Žeton za obnovitev"

msgid ""
"Recovery codes can only be used once. Remember to mark used ones as expired."
msgstr ""
"Kode za obnovitev je mogoče uporabiti samo enkrat. Ne pozabite označiti "
"uporabljenih kod kot potekle."

msgid "Enter the code from the app"
msgstr "Vnesite kodo iz aplikacije"

