msgid "Interface Language"
msgstr "Jezik vmesnika"

msgid "Translated languages"
msgstr "Prevedeni jeziki"

msgid ""
"Choose the languages you can translate to. These will be offered to you on "
"the dashboard for easier access to your chosen translations."
msgstr ""
"Izberite, v katere jezike lahko prevajate. Te vam bomo ponudili na vaši "
"nadzorni plošči, da boste imeli lažji dostop do vaših izbranih prevodov."

msgid "Secondary languages"
msgstr "Dodatni jeziki"

msgid ""
"Choose languages you can understand, strings in those languages will be "
"shown in addition to the source string."
msgstr ""
"Izberite jezike, ki jih razumete; nize v teh jezikih bomo prikazali skupaj z "
"izvirnim nizom."

msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Tema"

msgid "Hide completed translations on the dashboard"
msgstr "Na nadzorni plošči skrij končane prevode"

msgid "Show secondary translations in the Zen mode"
msgstr "Prikaži sekundarne prevode v načinu Zen"

msgid "Hide source if a secondary translation exists"
msgstr "Skrij vir, če obstaja sekundarni prevod"

msgid "Show all columns in lists using horizontal scrolling"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Instead of hiding columns on narrow screens, keep all columns and scroll the "
"table horizontally."
msgstr ""

msgid "Editor link"
msgstr "Povezava urejevalnika"

msgid ""
"Enter a custom URL to be used as link to the source code. You can use "
"{{branch}} for branch, {{filename}} and {{line}} as filename and line "
"placeholders."
msgstr ""
"Vnesite URL za povezavo do izvorne kode. V njem lahko uporabite prostornike "
"{{branch}} za vejo, {{filename}} in {{line}} za ime datoteke in vrstico."

msgid "Translation editor mode"
msgstr "Način urejevalnika prevodov"

msgid "Full editor"
msgstr "Polni urejevalnik"

msgid "Zen mode"
msgstr "Način Zen"

msgid "Zen editor mode"
msgstr "Način urejevalnika Zen"

msgid "Top to bottom"
msgstr "Od zgoraj navzdol"

msgid "Side by side"
msgstr "Eno ob drugem"

msgid "Special characters"
msgstr "Posebni znaki"

msgid ""
"You can specify additional special visual keyboard characters to be shown "
"while translating. It can be useful for characters you use frequently, but "
"are hard to type on your keyboard."
msgstr ""
"Določite lahko dodatne posebne znake navidezne tipkovnice, ki jih bomo "
"prikazali med prevajanjem. To je uporabno za znake, ki jih uporabljate "
"pogosto, vendar jih je težko vnesti s tipkovnico."

msgid "Number of nearby strings"
msgstr "Število bližnjih nizov"

msgid "Number of nearby strings to show in each direction in the full editor."
msgstr ""
"Število bližnjih nizov, ki jih bomo prikazali v vsaki smeri v polnem "
"urejevalniku."

msgid "Automatically watch projects on contribution"
msgstr "Samodejno spremljaj projekte z mojimi prispevki"

msgid ""
"Projects are added to your watched projects when you contribute to them."
msgstr ""

msgid "Contribute to personal translation memory"
msgstr "Prispevajte k osebnemu prevajalskemu pomnilniku"

msgid ""
"Allow your translations to be added to your personal translation memory."
msgstr "Dovolite, da se vaši prevodi dodajo v vaš osebni pomnilnik prevodov."

msgid "Watched translations"
msgstr "Spremljani prevodi"

msgid "All component lists"
msgstr "Vsi seznami komponent"

msgid "Component list"
msgstr "Seznam komponent"

msgid "Suggested translations"
msgstr "Predlagani prevodi"

msgid "Default dashboard view"
msgstr "Privzeti pogled pregledne plošče"

msgid "Default component list"
msgstr "Privzeti seznam komponent"

msgid ""
"You can receive notifications for watched projects and they are shown on the "
"dashboard by default."
msgstr ""
"Za spremljane projekte lahko prejemate obvestila in privzeto so prikazani na "
"nadzorni plošči."

msgid "Website URL"
msgstr "URL spletišča"

msgid "Contact URL"
msgstr "URL stika"

msgid ""
"Link to contact you online using services like Signal, SimpleX or Telegram."
msgstr ""
"Povezava za spletni stik z vami prek storitev, kot so Signal, SimpleX ali "
"Telegram."

msgid "Liberapay username"
msgstr "Uporabniško ime Liberapay"

msgid ""
"Liberapay is a platform to donate money to teams, organizations and "
"individuals."
msgstr ""
"Liberapay je platforma za zbiranje donacij za ekipe, organizacije in "
"posameznike."

msgid "Fediverse URL"
msgstr "URL Fediverse"

msgid ""
"Link to your Fediverse profile for federated services like Mastodon or "
"diaspora*."
msgstr ""
"Povežite s svojim profilom Fediverse za federativne storitve, kot sta "
